role: thumbnail

    icon coin size 200 set twemoji x 420 y 420 icon_look picture of coin hidden true
    icon ph size 200 set twemoji x 600 y 420 icon_look picture of "mobile phone" hidden true
    thumb b "Poor countries, few phones?" kind question hidden true

